[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Resource_am7ru"]
script = ExtResource("6_o336f")
markedup_text = "Burn the webs away."
requirement = SubResource("Resource_rjbii")
outcome = SubResource("Resource_jqhxq")
markedup_result_text = "Torches make quick work of the silk.

Unfortunately, the fire quickly spreads despite the dampness, and when the blaze dies down, all that can be found in the cave is ash.

The spiders and the ancient scrolls alike are lost."

